entries.en:
But I chose not to tell her.
Even among the men,
It's only twice;

She reported that the TV
from room 405 was missing but when we searched for it,
we found the TV in her car.

Hey,
if you end up teaching him,
you absolutely have to play favorites.

I could have gotten it
if I broke the lock, but you know,
leaving evidence would’ve been risky.
